{
 "family": "gemma4_unified",
 "about": "Gemma 4's unified language decoder (the text half of the multimodal Gemma4UnifiedForConditionalGeneration): a scaled word embedding (sqrt(d_model)), then per-layer RMSNorm -> attention -> post-attention norm + residual -> pre-FFN RMSNorm -> gelu-tanh gated MLP -> post-FFN norm + residual -> a per-layer scalar. Attention is MHA/GQA with a per-head q/k RMSNorm and a scale-less v RMSNorm; sliding layers use default RoPE (theta 10k) with a causal sliding-window mask, full layers use proportional RoPE (theta 1M, partial factor 0.25) with a plain causal mask and, when attention_k_eq_v, reuse the raw k projection as v.",
